{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Kaakee Circus","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8WOTcd5qCrJoQEp874D9pKu7akP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qSHqZtkLs7dIjtbzQex9WFoAtKo.jpg","description":"A small town in Tamil Nadu wakes up to chaos when a temple donation box is stolen from the sub-jail. Soon, the investigation led by two eccentric policemen unravels secrets more than they can handle.\n\nEnded · First aired 10 Apr 2026 · India · Language: Tamil\nStudio: Rise East Entertainments Pvt Ltd · Network: ZEE5\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 7/7\n\nOn your server — Audio: Tamil","releaseInfo":"2026","genres":["Comedy","Crime","Mystery","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.1","title":"The Walls","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In a faraway sub-jail, Constable Arjun struggles to manage thieves and learn the ways of the jail from Jailer Anbuselvan. Outside the jail, a mysterious break-in leads to chaos in the silent town.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iDQCL52ZVn0rBWZv7RhKTk3qYMs.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.2","title":"The Shadow of the Tree","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hari, a man in the village, witnesses disturbing signs and coincidences that trouble his family. Meanwhile, more unusual thefts rattle the town, making everyone suspect each other.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qSHqZtkLs7dIjtbzQex9WFoAtKo.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Two Petty Thieves","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Varghese, a coffin maker dealing with a troubled past and a failed marriage, becomes embroiled in the town's turmoil. Meanwhile, Arjun and Anbuselvan investigate the mystery of the undiyal money.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/50FRjO72iv2rHVS1PQ96PlRwXoK.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"The Passenger's Deception","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Arjun’s suspicions shift with each individual he encounters. The missing funds from the jail, online rumours, and new clues assist in piecing together the puzzle, yet the mystery remains unresolved.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b9ngWstlZtzIFm1gOJvK4UhgwS4.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Manoj's Yesterday","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A closer look into the lives of the town’s residents reveals struggles that could have pushed them to steal. Arjun’s job becomes harder, as he can’t draw a line between the victim and the culprit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4iwPSQnv1Oir6rvlZJTViyGLLYB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"The Rising Heat","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Arjun grows restless as the investigation leads to dead-ends and every clue comes with a twist. Anbuselvan urges him to be patient, but Arjun is confident the culprit is hiding in plain sight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AnAH17OcogMLD3znlhLVSdakbko.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9LYWFrZWUlMjBDaXJjdXMlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.7","title":"The Escaping Shadow","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2026-04-10T00:00:00.00